# App-generated session workspaces (dated) and workspace scaffolding
/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-1][0-9]-[0-3][0-9]-*/
.openscience/

# All app-generated data lives in ONE folder inside the project: sessions,
# the shared literature cache, the formula library, and legacy OpenCode
# workspaces. Local user output, deliberately not committed.
/data/
# Legacy locations (kept so older checkouts stay clean).
/sessions/
/literature/
/apps/desktop/sessions/

# Generated formula library (user output, kept local).
/formulas/

# Local run-index cache — a disposable SQLite index derived from
# .FormuLab/runs.jsonl (the real source of truth), rebuilt lazily by byte
# watermark; see apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/runs_index.rs's own doc
# comment. Untracked (Phase 12 Session 4A) after two committed copies on
# different branches were found to differ only by normal append-only
# growth (one branch's snapshot simply predated the other's), not
# corruption or divergence — this file should never have been tracked.
/.FormuLab/runs.db

# Phase 10 Session 5 — documentation fixture profile (regenerated by
# scripts/dev/seed-docs-fixture.ts; never the real app-data profile).
/.docs-fixture/
.aider*
